{"id":"89e092f6450e5227","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-basic-machine-computation.md","title":"Basic Machine Computation","display":"df-basic-machine-computation — Basic Machine Computation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-basic-machine-computation","aliases":["68-df-basic-machine-computation"],"display":"df-basic-machine-computation — Basic Machine Computation","depends_on":["[[68-df-basic-machine]]","[[68-df-number-theoretic-function]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§3 pp.4-5 / PDF 13-14","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"not-checked","revision_basis":"supplied-68-archive; local content and dependency review"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-basic-machine-computation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-basic-machine-computation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-basic-machine-computation — Basic Machine Computation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"87b1d4bf7c9d6143\" href=\"?note=87b1d4bf7c9d6143\" title=\"68-df-basic-machine\">68-df-basic-machine</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c524671590651be2\" href=\"?note=c524671590651be2\" title=\"68-df-number-theoretic-function\">68-df-number-theoretic-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§3 pp.4-5 / PDF 13-14"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-checked"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"supplied-68-archive; local content and dependency review"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathcal P\">\\(P\\in\\mathcal P\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in\\mathcal R\">\\(\\rho\\in\\mathcal R\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_P\">\\(\\delta_P\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"87b1d4bf7c9d6143\" href=\"?note=87b1d4bf7c9d6143\" title=\"68-df-basic-machine\">68-df-basic-machine</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,t\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k,t\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x=(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\\in\\mathbb N^k\">\\(\\vec x=(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\\in\\mathbb N^k\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,q\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(i,q\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_0,\\pi_1\">\\(\\pi_0,\\pi_1\\)</span> 的共同定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\\times\\mathcal R\">\\(\\mathbb N\\times\\mathcal R\\)</span>，函数值在下式给出。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho_{k,\\vec x}:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\rho_{k,\\vec x}:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C(P,k,\\vec x,\\cdot):\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\times\\mathcal R\">\\(C(P,k,\\vec x,\\cdot):\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\times\\mathcal R\\)</span> 由下式定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi_0(q,\\rho):=q,\\qquad\\pi_1(q,\\rho):=\\rho.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi_0(q,\\rho):=q,\\qquad\\pi_1(q,\\rho):=\\rho.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\rho_{k,\\vec x}(i):=\\begin{cases}x_i&amp;1\\le i\\le k,\\\\0&amp;i=0\\lor i&gt;k,\\end{cases}\\qquad\nC(P,k,\\vec x,0):=(0,\\rho_{k,\\vec x}),\\qquad\nC(P,k,\\vec x,t+1):=\\delta_P(C(P,k,\\vec x,t)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\rho_{k,\\vec x}(i):=\\begin{cases}x_i&amp;1\\le i\\le k,\\\\0&amp;i=0\\lor i&gt;k,\\end{cases}\\qquad\nC(P,k,\\vec x,0):=(0,\\rho_{k,\\vec x}),\\qquad\nC(P,k,\\vec x,t+1):=\\delta_P(C(P,k,\\vec x,t)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F_{P,k}:=\\{(\\vec x,y)\\in\\mathbb N^k\\times\\mathbb N:\\exists t\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists q\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\rho\\in\\mathcal R\\;(C(P,k,\\vec x,t)=(q,\\rho)\\land q\\ge\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\land y=\\rho(0))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F_{P,k}:=\\{(\\vec x,y)\\in\\mathbb N^k\\times\\mathbb N:\\exists t\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists q\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\rho\\in\\mathcal R\\;(C(P,k,\\vec x,t)=(q,\\rho)\\land q\\ge\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\land y=\\rho(0))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BMRec}:=\\{F_{P,k}:P\\in\\mathcal P\\land k\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{BMRec}:=\\{F_{P,k}:P\\in\\mathcal P\\land k\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 §3，印刷 pp.4–5 / PDF pp.13–14。输入装入寄存器 1 至 k，寄存器 0 初始为 0；停机后的寄存器 0 是输出。自然数递归定理给出唯一运行，停机后恒等延续保证所有停机时刻输出相同，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_{P,k}\">\\(F_{P,k}\\)</span> 为偏函数。空程序在零步停机并输出 0。原书的 recursive function 包括部分函数，本目录的 TotalRec 则专指全函数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-basic-machine","status":"resolved","id":"87b1d4bf7c9d6143","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-basic-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-number-theoretic-function","status":"resolved","id":"c524671590651be2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-number-theoretic-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-basic-machine","status":"resolved","id":"87b1d4bf7c9d6143","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$P\\in\\mathcal P$、$\\rho\\in\\mathcal R$ 及 $\\delta_P$ 见 [[68-df-basic-machine]]。$k,t\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\vec x=(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\\in\\mathbb N^k$。$i,q\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\pi_0,\\pi_1$ 的共同定义域为 $\\mathbb N\\times\\mathcal R$，函数值在下式给出。$\\rho_{k,\\vec x}:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$，$C(P,k,\\vec x,\\cdot):\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\times\\mathcal R$ 由下式定义。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P\\in\\mathcal P","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho\\in\\mathcal R","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta_P","display":false},{"tex":"k,t\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x=(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\\in\\mathbb N^k","display":false},{"tex":"i,q\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_0,\\pi_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N\\times\\mathcal R","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho_{k,\\vec x}:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"C(P,k,\\vec x,\\cdot):\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\times\\mathcal R","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_0(q,\\rho):=q,\\qquad\\pi_1(q,\\rho):=\\rho.","display":true},{"tex":"\\rho_{k,\\vec x}(i):=\\begin{cases}x_i&1\\le i\\le k,\\\\0&i=0\\lor i>k,\\end{cases}\\qquad\nC(P,k,\\vec x,0):=(0,\\rho_{k,\\vec x}),\\qquad\nC(P,k,\\vec x,t+1):=\\delta_P(C(P,k,\\vec x,t)).","display":true},{"tex":"F_{P,k}:=\\{(\\vec x,y)\\in\\mathbb N^k\\times\\mathbb N:\\exists t\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists q\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\rho\\in\\mathcal R\\;(C(P,k,\\vec x,t)=(q,\\rho)\\land q\\ge\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\land y=\\rho(0))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BMRec}:=\\{F_{P,k}:P\\in\\mathcal P\\land k\\in\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"F_{P,k}","display":false}],"bytes":1978,"backlinks":[{"id":"31939e9d65c515ab","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$s\\in\\mathbb N$；$h_s(e,A,x),u_s(e,A,x)\\in\\mathbb N$ 是以下新增的有界停机时刻和查询界。$\\pi_0$ 取 [[68-df-basic-machine-computation]] 的配置第一投影。$h_s=s+1$ 是未在给定步数内停机的标记；有限集合 $\\{0\\}$ 使查询界在没有查询时也有定义。"},{"id":"2517b868f96ae323","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$e,k,s,q,L\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k$，$P\\in\\mathcal P$，$\\rho\\in\\mathcal R$。$P_e,\\mathrm{Prog}$ 见 [[68-df-program-index]]；$C,\\pi_0,\\pi_1,\\mathcal R$ 见 [[68-df-basic-machine-computation]] 及其上游。$\\operatorname{sc},\\operatorname{sd},\\operatorname{cd},\\operatorname{clh},\\mathrm{Seq}$ 见 [[68-df-sequence-code]]。$\\operatorname{last}$ 只在非空有限自然数序列上定义；$\\operatorname{cc}_L:\\mathbb N\\times\\mathcal R\\to\\mathbb N$ 编码前 $L$ 个寄存器。$T_k$ 的定义域为 $\\mathbb N\\times\\mathbb N^k\\times\\mathbb N$，$U:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$。"},{"id":"124259d2584af1b6","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$e,x,y,s,t,q,i,j,n\\in\\mathbb N$。$\\chi_A$ 见 [[68-df-recursive-set]]；$\\mathcal I,\\mathcal R$ 及寄存器更新见 [[68-df-basic-machine]]，$\\rho_{1,x}$ 见 [[68-df-basic-machine-computation]]。有限序列编码 $\\operatorname{sc}$ 见 [[68-df-sequence-code]]。"},{"id":"45acd372bb8b9947","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$m,k\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\vec\\alpha\\in\\mathcal B^m$，$\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k$。$\\mathcal I,\\mathcal R$ 见 [[68-df-basic-machine]]。初态 $\\rho_{k,\\vec x}$ 见 [[68-df-basic-machine-computation]]，将该处 $x_1,\\ldots,x_k$ 依次取为本处 $x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1}$。$P$ 是下式定义的程序，$q,t\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\rho\\in\\mathcal R$。实寄存器编号 $r$ 从 $0$ 开始；$\\rho[i\\leftarrow v]$ 为单点更新。"},{"id":"d018b8faa50481e8","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BMRec}$ 见 [[68-df-basic-machine-computation]]，$\\mathrm{PartRec}$ 见 [[68-df-partial-recursive-function-class]]，$\\varphi_e^{(k)}$ 见 [[68-df-kleene-normal-form]]。"},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-basic-machine-computation]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-basic-machine-computation]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"数值函数与基本机器：[[68-df-number-theoretic-function]] → [[68-df-basic-machine]] → [[68-df-basic-machine-computation]] → [[68-df-program-index]] → [[68-df-kleene-t-predicate]] → [[68-df-kleene-normal-form]]。"}],"outgoing":["87b1d4bf7c9d6143","c524671590651be2"]}